From ffa70f7c090abf7ee5f615fbf7c8e45e8397c28c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:13:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] Use the WebSplat CubeCL fork

[patch] every CubeCL crate to a sibling checkout of the fork (same revision
burn pins, plus deferred destroy() of deallocated buffers in wasm, which
keeps browser GPU memory near the native working set).
